  "translatedBlocks": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df1e080cd307d35b",
      "translationZh": "我在这个智能体平台上工作了7到8个月，最近将其开源了：https://meowbert.com",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df53961cfe72b9a3",
      "translationZh": "我知道目前这类项目已经有很多了。我构建这个项目是因为我想要一个既整洁、又支持自托管、能妥善完成任务，并且适合进行长期项目和自主运行任务的东西。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eb7d0c6fccfe28c",
      "translationZh": "每个任务都在自己的 Docker 容器中运行，其中包含 shell、浏览器、Python、Node 以及用于 Office 文档和 PDF 的工具。文件和内存保存在项目中。任务还可以按计划运行，并在完成后将结果发送到 Telegram、Discord 或电子邮件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72449f2f7ae8b02e",
      "translationZh": "例如，我有一个定时任务，其中代理通过查询日志和系统信息来执行定期的健康和安全检查，并在发现问题时通知我。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36f850e9183fcbce",
      "translationZh": "您的自定义技能也可以直接添加到根目录的 skills/ 文件夹中，我正在计划让其他人设置起来更容易。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6774c4100f2ccd48",
      "translationZh": "它适用于任何支持 OpenAI Responses API 的服务器。我主要在 Ollama 上测试了 Codex 模型和 Qwen 9B，在一个小型 VPS 上，它对我项目帮助很大。仅支持 chat/completions 的 API 目前还不能工作。我计划很快添加对它们的支持，因为我知道它们使用非常广泛。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51eba7dd0294e020",
      "translationZh": "已知局限，我正在尝试改进这些：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba2d38d95ac5107d",
      "translationZh": "它需要 \"/v1/responses\" API 格式，我知道这会排除一些设置，并且将对它们的支持添加到待办列表中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b94c027810f0b8d",
      "translationZh": "较小/较旧的模型在工具调用方面仍然遇到困难",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fa53d83eb231cdd",
      "translationZh": "沙盒镜像目前仅支持 x86-64。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e081bf006c0642bf",
      "translationZh": "它采用 AGPL 许可，代码托管在 GitHub 上：https://github.com/XInTheDark/meowbert-ai-agent",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f7034635d01abb",
      "translationZh": "我非常感谢任何形式的反馈。我发布这个项目的一个主要原因是为了向社区和经验更丰富的开发者学习。欢迎提出任何问题和反馈！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b86663f450e22db",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/XInTheDark 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
